  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have The Fever</em></p>\n<p>You have fully understood the essence of your technique. As an action for 10 Cursed Energy, you can summon the <em>Love Train</em>. This is a 200 foot long, 20 feet wide Line attack in which a creature within range must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure they are launched 200 feet and take 15d6 bludgeoning damage. The train is summoned on a space of your choice within 30ft, and the opponent is launched in the opposite direction.</p>",
